  "body": "https://github.com/whatwg/html/commit/c9fddd7082cd2b926f7081cd276c842b09304392 introduced COOP with the secure context check using [\"Is _url_ potentially trustworthy?\"](https://w3c.github.io/webappsec-secure-contexts/#is-url-trustworthy). This gives the wrong answer for cases where the environment's HTTPS state is \"deprecated\".\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5659 can provide the foundation to fix this, allowing us to check the environment, instead of the URL.",
